  "solution": "### 💡 Intuition & Approach\nThe implementation computes **MTP Head** by following direct architectural principles, leveraging vectorized operations to ensure both correctness and optimal runtime efficiency.\n\n### ⚡ Python Reference Implementation\n```python\nimport numpy as np\ndef solution(hidden, head_weights):\n    h=np.asarray(hidden,dtype=float); w=np.asarray(head_weights,dtype=float)\n    # One projection per future-token offset: weights shape [offsets, hidden, vocab].\n    return np.einsum(\"...h,ohv->...ov\",h,w).tolist()\n```\n\n### ⏱️ Complexity Analysis\n- **Time Complexity**: $\\mathcal{O}(N)$ where $N$ represents the primary sequence length or dimension.\n- **Space Complexity**: $\\mathcal{O}(N)$ auxiliary memory for computing and storing output representations.",
